      "heading": "Configuration",
      "content": "OVOS `~/.config/mycroft/mycroft.conf`\n\n{\n  \"PHAL\": {\n    \"phal-plugin-save-conversations\": {\n      \"save_path\": \"/home/ovos/.cache/transcripts\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nNeon `~/.config/neon/neon.yaml`\n\nPHAL:\n  phal-plugin-save-conversations:\n    save_path: \"/home/neon/.cache/transcripts\""
